---
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-mc-border section-block" style="background:#0a0a0a;">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">

    <div class="section-prompt mb-10 font-mono text-xs text-mc-dark-gray">
      <span class="text-mc-green text-glow-green">▸</span>
      <span class="ml-2 uppercase tracking-widest">About</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start stagger-group">

      <div class="stagger-item">
        <h2 class="font-minecraft text-mc-white mb-6" style="font-size:clamp(0.75rem,1.6vw,0.95rem);line-height:2;">
          Passionate about building<br/>
          <span class="text-mc-yellow text-glow-yellow">impactful</span> digital products.
        </h2>
        <p class="font-mono text-mc-gray text-sm leading-loose">
          Frontend Developer with over
          <span class="text-mc-aqua text-glow-aqua">3 years of experience</span>
          in developing scalable, high-performance web and mobile applications.
          Strong emphasis on clean, maintainable code and efficient user interactions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="stagger-item space-y-4 font-mono text-sm">
        <p class="text-mc-gray leading-loose">
          Skilled in
          <span class="text-mc-yellow">React.js</span>,
          <span class="text-mc-yellow">TypeScript</span>,
          <span class="text-mc-yellow">Angular</span>, and
          <span class="text-mc-yellow">Ionic</span>.
          Enthusiastic about learning new technologies and tackling complex challenges.
        </p>
        <p class="text-mc-gray leading-loose">
          Highly adaptable and eager to explore new programming languages and frameworks
          to build innovative digital solutions.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a href="#contact"
             class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-mc-green text-glow-green
                    border-b border-mc-green hover:gap-3 transition-all duration-200">
            Get in touch <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
